  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Household observatory",
    "overview": "A calm, clear, data-led view of household energy and money. Neutral surfaces recede so quantities, relationships, and exceptions carry the attention. Bright accents identify data; ordinary controls remain restrained.\n\nThe system is flat and restrained: small controls, clear labels, quiet dividers, and enough space to distinguish tasks. The orbit, timeline, and cash-flow drawing are instruments with their own geometry, composed within the same shell and theme.",
